{"page":89,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:66","surah":4,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّا كَتَبْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ أَنِ ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَكُمْ أَوِ ٱخْرُجُوا۟ مِن دِيَـٰرِكُم مَّا فَعَلُوهُ إِلَّا قَلِيلٌ مِّنْهُمْ ۖ وَلَوْ أَنَّهُمْ فَعَلُوا۟ مَا يُوعَظُونَ بِهِۦ لَكَانَ خَيْرًا لَّهُمْ وَأَشَدَّ تَثْبِيتًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"if We had ordered, ‘Lay down your lives’ or ‘Leave your homes,’ they would not have done so, except for a few- it would have been far better for them and stronger confirmation of their faith, if they had done as they were told,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"[that] We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَتَبْنَا","en_gloss":"(had) decreed","transliteration":"katabnā","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Kill","transliteration":"uq'tulū","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنفُسَكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusakum","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱخْرُجُوا۟","en_gloss":"Go forth","transliteration":"ukh'rujū","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِكُم","en_gloss":"your homes","transliteration":"diyārikum","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَعَلُوهُ","en_gloss":"they would have done it","transliteration":"faʿalūhu","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَلِيلٌۭ","en_gloss":"a few","transliteration":"qalīlun","verse_key":"4:66"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ ۖ