loss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:70"}]},{"verse_key":"4:71","surah":4,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ خُذُوا۟ حِذْرَكُمْ فَٱنفِرُوا۟ ثُبَاتٍ أَوِ ٱنفِرُوا۟ جَمِيعًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, be on your guard. March [to battle] in small groups or as one body.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خُذُوا۟","en_gloss":"Take","transliteration":"khudhū","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حِذْرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your precautions","transliteration":"ḥidh'rakum","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَٱنفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and advance","transliteration":"fa-infirū","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُبَاتٍ","en_gloss":"(in) groups","transliteration":"thubātin","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوِ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"awi","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱنفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"advance","transliteration":"infirū","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all together","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"4:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:71"}]},{"verse_key":"4:72","surah":4,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ مِنكُمْ لَمَن لَّيُبَطِّئَنَّ فَإِنْ أَصَـٰبَتْكُم مُّصِيبَةٌ قَالَ قَدْ أَنْعَمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىَّ إِذْ لَمْ أَكُن مَّعَهُمْ شَهِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Among you there is the sort of person who is sure to lag behind: if a calamity befalls you, he says, ‘God has been gracious to me that I was not there with them,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"4:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"4:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَمَن","en_gloss":"(i